     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<br><br>I&#39;m trying out the useful new <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">geom_label</span> geom in <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">ggplot2 1.0.1.9003</span>. I would like to remove the border from the labels or at least make it much thinner. Using the <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">size</span> or <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">colour</span> arguments to <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">geom_label</span> won&#39;t work because it also controls the text. I&#39;m not sure which theme element the border of <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">geom_label</span> inherits from but I tried changing the <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">line</span> and <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">rect</span>. These had no effect on the label.<br><br>I can get what I want using <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">geom_label(colour = NA) + geom_text()</span> but it seems a bit hacky to me. I also can&#39;t see how it would work if I wanted a thinner line rather than <b>no</b> line. Is there a better way?<br><br>SessionInfo and lame example code at the end.<br><br>Thanks for reading,<br><br>Tom<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iris</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>g </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iris</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sepal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sepal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Species</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># default plot</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>g </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># removes text as well as border</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>g </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colour </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># makes text too small</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>g </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># doesn&#39;t do anything to labels</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>g </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rect </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_rect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        line </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># gets me what I want</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>g </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colour </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  geom_text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sessionInfo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>R versio